abstract: "Benchmarks and defect reproductions for group-quantized LLM components on the Apple Neural Engine: ANE-versus-GPU speed, memory and thermal measurements, reproducible Core ML and Core AI toolchain defects, and a candidate arithmetic model of quantized execution, with offline checks against bundled records."
keywords:
  - "Apple Neural Engine"
  - "Core ML"
  - "Core AI"
  - "quantization"
  - "LLM inference"
  - "benchmark"
